          <number>2</number>
         </property>
         <item>
          <widget class="ComboBox" name="cmb000">
           <property name="minimumSize">
            <size>
             <width>180</width>
             <height>19</height>
            </size>
           </property>
           <property name="maximumSize">
            <size>
             <width>999</width>
             <height>19</height>
            </size>
           </property>
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>Preset — this panel's bake settings under a name: Packing, Resolution, Samples, GI Samples, Bounces, Adaptive Sampling, Include Environment, Denoise and Beside Material Textures.

   The built-ins (italic, read-only) — preview, quest, desktop — set the quality dials only. Save (the disk icon) stores the current settings under a name you type (Enter to commit); the ⋯ menu renames, deletes or opens the preset folder. A * after the name means a setting has changed since the preset loaded.

   Not saved: Scope, Exclude, Processor, Output Directory and Name — they belong to a scene or a machine. A headless bake reads the same presets: LightmapBaker.from_preset(name).</string>
           </property>
           <property name="frame">
            <bool>false</bool>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item>
          <widget class="QPushButton" name="btn_reset_defaults">
           <property name="minimumSize">
            <size>
             <width>0</width>
             <height>19</height>
            </size>
           </property>
           <property name="maximumSize">
            <size>
             <width>16777215</width>
             <height>19</height>
            </size>
           </property>
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>Restore every setting on this panel to its default.</string>
           </property>
           <property name="text">
            <string>Reset to Defaults</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item>
          <widget class="QPushButton" name="b000">
           <property name="sizePolicy">
            <sizepolicy hsizetype="Preferred" vsizetype="Fixed">
             <horstretch>0</horstretch>
